  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature misses you with a melee attack roll, you can take a Reaction and expend one Superiority Die to make a melee attack roll with a weapon or an Unarmed Strike against the creature. If you hit, add the Superiority Die to the attack's damage.</p><section id=\"secret-aL4TzEY3Wy7mzsWY\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Riposte Damage</strong> reaction activity allows you to select the type of damage it should deal in the roll dialog and will consume a use of your Superiority Die.</p></section>",
